{
  "round_analysis": "Round 0, no prior empirical feedback. Strategy: maximize diversity across Alpha158 subspaces (KBar [0,9], price/VWAP [9,29], momentum/vol/trend [29,95], volume/order-flow [95,158]) and across time scales (3..20). To satisfy the non-collapse gate (r_eff(P) >= 1.25, off-diagonal cosine < 0.98) every descriptor uses d >= 3 weakly correlated channels or composites mixing orthogonal mechanisms (trend, volatility, order-flow, tail asymmetry). Half the portfolio is novel symbolic multi-channel tensor predicates; half is DSL composites (concat/mix) spanning complementary mechanisms and scales. Rationale: LUSI kernel P(X)=phi phi^T concentrates residual energy along cross-sectionally informative directions; weakly correlated multi-scale descriptors avoid rank collapse while capturing distinct microstructure/regime structure that a global ones-shrinkage cannot.",
