        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "statistical",
      "name": "Short-Horizon Reversal vs Volume Shock",
      "rationale": "Intraday candlestick morphology interacts with volume shocks to define short-term reversal strength; residual variance along this axis should predict 1-day IC.",
